GF$6(-I$mtdGF$6(-I#mnGF$6&Q\"1F'/%+foregroundGQ([0,0,0]F'/%)readonlyGQ
&falseF'/%,mathvariantGQ'normalF'/%)rowalignGQ!F'/%,columnalignGFF/%+g
roupalignGFF/%(rowspanGF:/%+columnspanGF:F4F4FDFGFI-F26(-F56(-F86&Q\"2
F'F;F>FAFDFGFIFKFMFQFQFDFGFI-F26(-F56(-F86&Q\"3F'F;F>FAFDFGFIFKFMFXFXF
DFGFI/%&alignGQ%axisF'/FEQ)baselineF'/FHQ&rightF'/FJQ'|frleft|hrF'/%/a
lignmentscopeGQ%trueF'/%,columnwidthGQ%autoF'/%&widthGFeo/%+rowspacing
