{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 130 "These formulae lead to an efficient rec
ursive algorithm for computing integer powers using the minimal number
 of multiplications. " }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0
 "" {TEXT 302 3 "(a)" }{TEXT 324 19 " Write a procedure " }{TEXT 303 
6 "MatPow" }{TEXT 324 82 "(X,n::integer) to implement this algorithm f
or computing powers of matrices. Test " }{TEXT 304 6 "MatPow" }{TEXT 
324 23 "(<<1|2>,<3|4>>,12) and " }{TEXT 305 6 "MatPow" }{TEXT 324 20 "
(<<1|2>,<3|4>>,-12)." }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 
"" {TEXT 306 3 "(b)" }{TEXT 205 19 " Write a procedure " }{TEXT 307 7 
"PolyPow" }{TEXT 205 182 "(X,n::integer) to implement this algorithm f
or computing powers of numbers and polynomials. Your procedure needs t
o exapnd each product of polynomials in order to be effective. Test " 
}{TEXT 308 7 "PolyPow" }{TEXT 205 10 "(123,12), " }{TEXT 309 7 "PolyPo
w" }{TEXT 205 9 "(123,-12)" }{TEXT 310 9 ", PolyPow" }{TEXT 205 15 "(x
^2+1,12) and " }{TEXT 311 7 "PolyPow" }{TEXT 205 13 "(x^2+1,-12). " }
{TEXT 205 0 "" }}}{EXCHG {PARA 0 "> " 0 "" {MPLTEXT 1 0 0 "" }}}
{EXCHG {PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 312 9 "Problem 4" }{TEXT 324 3 ".  " }}
{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 313 13 "Happy n
umbers" }{TEXT 324 216 " are positive integers which end up at 1 under
 iteration of the \"sum of squares of digits map\". That is, if one de
fines f(x) to be the sum of the squares of the decimal digits of  the \+
positive integer x, then  x  is " }{TEXT 314 5 "happy" }{TEXT 324 56 "
 if for some positive integer n we have (f@@n)(x) = 1.  " }}{PARA 0 ""
 0 "" {TEXT 324 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 13 "For example, " }}
{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 16 "f(7) = \+
7^2=49,  " }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 21 "f(49) = 4^2+9^2=97,  " }}
{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 22 "f(97) = 9^2+7^2=130,  " }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "
" {TEXT 324 26 "f(130) = 1^2+3^2+0^2 = 10," }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 
324 21 "f(10) = 1^2+0^2 = 1. " }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 0 "" }}
{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 14 "So 7 is happy." }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 
324 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 33 "The first few happy numbers a
re \n" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 61 "1,7,10,13,19,23,28,31,32,44,49,
68,70,79,82,86,91,94,97,100. \n" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 324 86 "Write
 a  procedure that will declare a positive integer  x to be happy (i.e
., returns " }{TEXT 315 4 "true" }{TEXT 324 50 ") if the n-th iterate \+
of f starting with x gives 1" }{TEXT 316 10 " for some " }{XPPEDIT 18 
